timeline
    title BLEspresso GATT Attribute Map — Service 0x1400 (Brew) + Service 0x1500 (PID)

    section Brew Service 0x1400  |  UUID base f364adc9-b000-xxxx-ba50-05ca45bf8abc  |  ble_cus_espresso_char_add()
        0x1401 Machine Status
            : Decl  S1+1  Props=Read+Notify
            : Value S1+2  10 B  ASCII string
            : CCCD  S1+3  0x0001=Notify ON
            : Field — (status string)
        0x1402 Boiler Water Temp
            : Decl  S1+4  Props=Read+Notify
            : Value S1+5  4 B  XXXD format (tenths degC)
            : CCCD  S1+6  0x0001=Notify 1s period
            : Field boilerTempDegC
        0x1403 Boiler Setpoint
            : Decl  S1+7  Props=Read+Write
            : Value S1+8  4 B  XXXD format (tenths degC)
            : Field boilerTempSetpointDegC  default 95.5
        0x1404 Brew Preset Temp
            : Decl  S1+9  Props=Read+Write
            : Value S1+10  4 B  XXXD format (tenths degC)
            : Field brewTempDegC  default 95.0
        0x1405 Steam Preset Temp
            : Decl  S1+11  Props=Read+Write
            : Value S1+12  4 B  XXXD format (tenths degC)
            : Field steamTempDegC  default 110.0
        0x1406 Pre-Infusion Power
            : Decl  S1+13  Props=Read+Write
            : Value S1+14  3 B  XXD format (tenths %)
            : Field profPreInfusePwr  default 75.0
        0x1407 Pre-Infusion Time
            : Decl  S1+15  Props=Read+Write
            : Value S1+16  3 B  XXD format (tenths s)
            : Field profPreInfuseTmr  default 8.0
        0x1408 Infusion Power
            : Decl  S1+17  Props=Read+Write
            : Value S1+18  4 B  XXXD format (tenths %)
            : Field profInfusePwr  default 100.0
        0x1409 Infusion Time
            : Decl  S1+19  Props=Read+Write
            : Value S1+20  3 B  XXD format (tenths s)
            : Field profInfuseTmr  default 8.0
        0x140A Declining Power
            : Decl  S1+21  Props=Read+Write
            : Value S1+22  4 B  XXXD format (tenths %)
            : Field profTaperingPwr  default 85.0
        0x140B Declining Time
            : Decl  S1+23  Props=Read+Write
            : Value S1+24  3 B  XXD format (tenths s)
            : Field profTaperingTmr  default 8.0  -> sets flag_brew_cfg

    section PID Service 0x1500  |  same UUID base as 0x1400  |  ble_cus_controller_char_add()
        0x1501 P Term
            : Decl  S2+1  Props=Read+Write
            : Value S2+2  4 B  XXXD format
            : Field pidPTerm  default 9.5
        0x1502 I Term
            : Decl  S2+3  Props=Read+Write
            : Value S2+4  3 B  XXD format
            : Field pidITerm  default 0.3
        0x1503 I Max
            : Decl  S2+5  Props=Read+Write
            : Value S2+6  4 B  XXXD format
            : Field pidImaxTerm  default 100.0
        0x1504 D Term
            : Decl  S2+7  Props=Read+Write
            : Value S2+8  3 B  XXD format
            : Field pidDTerm  default 0.0
        0x1505 P Boost
            : Decl  S2+9  Props=Read+Write
            : Value S2+10  3 B  XXD format
            : Field pidPboostTerm  default 1.0
        0x1506 I Boost
            : Decl  S2+11  Props=Read+Write
            : Value S2+12  3 B  XXD format
            : Field pidIboostTerm  default 6.5  -> sets flag_pid_cfg
